  "description": "A true AI agent for pixel-perfect web cloning. Multi-agent architecture built on Claude Agent SDK with 40+ specialized tools. Clones from CSS \u0026 structured blocks—not screenshots—enabling perfect reproduction where single-model tools like Cursor/Claude Code fail.",
